\right.\]`, `$f(f(f(f(f(4)))))$`, `$f(4) = 4^2-4(4)-1=-1$`, `$f(-1)=(-1)^2=1$`, `$f(1)=1^2=1$`, `$f(f(f(f(f(4)))))=f(f(f(f(-1))))=f(f(f(1)))=f(f(1))=f(1)=\boxed{1}$`, `\boxed{1}`
