- 保護する記号・タグ: `${(2p^2 - 1)(3p^2 + 4)}$`, `$2p^2 - 1$`, `$3p^2$`, `$4$`, `\begin{align*}
(2p^2 - 1)(3p^2 + 4) &= (2p^2 - 1) \cdot (3p^2) + (2p^2 - 1) \cdot 4
\end{align*}`, `\begin{align*}
(3p^2)(2p^2 - 1) + 4(2p^2 - 1) &= 6p^4 - 3p^2 + 8p^2 - 4\\
&= \boxed{6p^4 + 5p^2 - 4}
\end{align*}`, `\boxed{6p^4 + 5p^2 - 4}`
- 数学用語・文脈: 代数の展開の問題。「Expand the product」は「積を展開しなさい」、「distributive property」は「分配法則」、「combine like terms」は「同類項をまとめる」とする。

original_solution:
When using the distributive property for the first time, we add the product of $2p^2 - 1$ and $3p^2$ to the product of $2p^2 - 1$ and $4$:

\begin{align*}
(2p^2 - 1)(3p^2 + 4) &= (2p^2 - 1) \cdot (3p^2) + (2p^2 - 1) \cdot 4
\end{align*}We use the distributive property again and combine like terms:

\begin{align*}
(3p^2)(2p^2 - 1) + 4(2p^2 - 1) &= 6p^4 - 3p^2 + 8p^2 - 4\\
&= \boxed{6p^4 + 5p^2 - 4}
\end{align*}

translated_solution:
最初に分配法則を用いると、$2p^2 - 1$ と $3p^2$ の積に、$2p^2 - 1$ と $4$ の積を加えることになる。

\begin{align*}
(2p^2 - 1)(3p^2 + 4) &= (2p^2 - 1) \cdot (3p^2) + (2p^2 - 1) \cdot 4
\end{align*}

さらにもう一度分配法則を用い、同類項をまとめる。

\begin{align*}
(3p^2)(2p^2 - 1) + 4(2p^2 - 1) &= 6p^4 - 3p^2 + 8p^2 - 4\\
&= \boxed{6p^4 + 5p^2 - 4}
\end{align*}

original_solution:
It's certainly possible to just calculate the complex number $2\omega^2-4\omega-30$ by just plugging in the value of $\omega$, but it's computationally simpler to use the fact that $|ab|=|a||b|$ and our knowledge of factoring quadratics: \begin{align*}
|2\omega^2-4\omega-30|&=|2(\omega-5)(\omega+3)|\\
&=2|\omega-5|\cdot|\omega+3|\\
&=2|-4-5i|\cdot|4-5i|\\
&=2\sqrt{(-4)^2+5^2}\sqrt{4^2+5^2}\\
&=\boxed{82}
\end{align*}

translated_solution:
